# Home Aquarium: Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 9, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames (Peter Wraae Marino)
**Contact:** axiomaragames@gmail.com

Home Aquarium ("the app") is a guide and companion for freshwater aquarium keepers: fish species profiles, tank setup, water quality, feeding, plant and health guides, a compatibility checker, calculators, a quiz, and a log for your own tanks. This policy explains what information the app handles, and lists the credits and licences for the software, fonts and pictures it contains.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you enter stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **My Tanks:** the tanks you add (the name and volume you give them, how often you change water), the dates of your water changes, the water test readings you enter, and the species you mark as living in each tank
- **Favorites:** the species you mark with the heart
- **Quiz scores:** your best score in each quiz
- **Settings:** your units (°C or °F, litres or gallons) and whether you have seen the welcome screen
- **Full version:** whether the full version has been unlocked, so it stays unlocked when you are offline

This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. You can delete it at any time in Settings > Clear all my data, and it is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings. If you use Android's own device backup, Android may include these settings in your backup to your Google account; that backup is handled by Google, not by us.

The app starts empty: it contains no example tanks, favourites or other entries.

## Purchases

The app is free to download. The full version is a one-time in-app purchase made through Google Play. Google Play handles the payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play whether the full version has been bought on your Google account, so it can unlock it, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to our servers or any other server, apart from Google Play for the purchase described above. All species profiles, guides and pictures are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts, photos or device identifiers.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your camera or microphone.
- It does not send notifications.

## Children

The app is a general reference about aquarium keeping and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Health and care information

The care, water and health information in the app is general guidance for hobbyists. Fish, water and conditions vary. It is not veterinary advice; when in doubt, ask a specialist aquarium shop or an aquatic veterinarian.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, a change cannot affect information you have already given us.

## Contact

Questions about this policy: axiomaragames@gmail.com

